At talagang…

294
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:50,240
Ayaw kong saktan ang sinuman sa inyo.

295
00:22:51,080 --> 00:22:53,560
Pero sa huli, pareho ko kayong sinasaktan.

296
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,680
Pero kailangan kong…

297
00:22:57,680 --> 00:22:59,600
