Bilisan mo.

396
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:59,520
- Wag mong siraan si Papa!
- Nakikinig ka ba?

397
00:31:59,600 --> 00:32:01,840
- Oo!
- Nakita ko mismo, lintik!

398
