446
00:37:22,120 --> 00:37:24,800
Alam kong si Ivan 'yon. Ituloy ko ba?

447
00:37:25,800 --> 00:37:26,640
Wala nang iba.

448
00:37:27,800 --> 00:37:28,920
Tingin ko mayroon.

449
00:37:30,400 --> 00:37:31,760
